f-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 44% of normal in July to August and 38% in November to December. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 48% and February to March at 50% on the middle of the grids. Grid 18766 had its driest year in 1963 at 64%.</p>"}
